{"title": "Elminster's Library", "pageid": 28716, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elminster's_Library", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Three Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ElminstersLibrary.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ElminstersLibrary.png/300px-ElminstersLibrary.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ElminstersLibrary.png/450px-ElminstersLibrary.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ElminstersLibrary.png/600px-ElminstersLibrary.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ElminstersLibrary.png/300px-ElminstersLibrary.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ElminstersLibrary.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Elminster's Library interior  </div></figcaption></figure><b>Elminster's Library</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It is one of thematic parlours on the Upper Floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Elminster's Library is the first room on the right when ascending to the Upper Floor of the pleasure house.\n</p><p>This room is a pleasure den themed around schooling, knowledge, and subjugation. It is stylized as a large atheneum in blue and white hues, with several large bookcases, scroll stacks and alchemical appliances. Side by side, there are some details which appeal to the room's specifics: chains and cuffs hanging from columns and a dog collar in the corner. The room is normally locked, but easily opened without interruption by means of a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> or obtaining a copy of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress_Rooms_Key\" title=\"Sharess' Caress Rooms Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress_Rooms_Key\" title=\"Sharess' Caress Rooms Key\">Sharess' Caress Rooms Key</a> (see below).\n</p><p>The resident of this parlour is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ffion_Goldgrind\" title=\"Ffion Goldgrind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png/25px-Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png/38px-Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png/50px-Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ffion Goldgrind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png/25px-Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Portrait_Ffion_Goldgrind.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ffion_Goldgrind\" title=\"Ffion Goldgrind\">Ffion Goldgrind</a>, also known as <i>\"The Stern Librarian\"</i>. However, by the time the party arrive at Wyrm's Crossing, she has been murdered and her body concealed in the hidden room in <a href=\"/wiki/Fraygo%27s_Flophouse\" title=\"Fraygo's Flophouse\">Fraygo's Flophouse</a>. \n</p><p>The party can talk to Sharess' Caress's proprietor <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amira\" title=\"Amira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/25px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/38px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/50px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mamzell Amira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/25px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amira\" title=\"Amira\">Mamzell Amira</a> about Ffion: this starts the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\">Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion</a> quest. In this case, Amira gives the key to the room, so the party can find any clues on Ffion's disappearance. Otherwise, a copy of the key can be taken from the nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Nymph%27s_Grotto\" title=\"Nymph's Grotto\">Nymph's Grotto</a>, on the shelf near the entrance.\n</p><p>Once inside the library, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ffion%27s_Journal\" title=\"Ffion's Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ffion%27s_Journal\" title=\"Ffion's Journal\">Ffion's Journal</a> can be found on a desk, providing the needed clue. If the party have already found Ffion's body, they can tell Amira about it and get the \"reward\", as if they have taken and finished the quest. \n</p><p>In bookcases around the room a number of thematic titles can be found, as well as several suitable-to-occasion sets of <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a> in the wardrobe behind the bath tube. One of the scroll stacks contain a scroll of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dimension_Door\" title=\"Dimension Door\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Dimension_Door_Icon.webp/25px-Dimension_Door_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Dimension_Door_Icon.webp/38px-Dimension_Door_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Dimension_Door_Icon.webp/50px-Dimension_Door_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dimension Door\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Dimension_Door_Icon.webp/25px-Dimension_Door_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Dimension_Door_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dimension_Door\" title=\"Dimension Door\">Dimension Door</a>, while the other contains a random Uncommon or Rare one. The wooden ladder from the balcony of this suite leads to the roof, allowing the party to move around the area unhampered.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyrm's Crossing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharess' Caress\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\">Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ffion%27s_Journal\" title=\"Ffion's Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Book_Tome_U_Item_Icon.png\